# Reference run (Windows / Intel ifort, amrs_rel24-003, 3 years 1987-1989): the inputs, plus the
# outputs that scripts/regress.py compares: SITE75.DWS .MWS .RCH .SWT .WSS and MODFLOW/amf_*.out.
# Everything else a model run writes is ignored, so a run in this folder leaves nothing to commit
# (copy the folder first: regress.py already does).

# APEX outputs (<site>.<ext>); keep the five that are compared
SITE75.*
!SITE75.DWS
!SITE75.MWS
!SITE75.RCH
!SITE75.SWT
!SITE75.WSS

# MODFLOW / RT3D outputs; keep the compared *.out files
MODFLOW/amf_*
!MODFLOW/amf_*.out
MODFLOW/mf_1000.fhd
MODFLOW/mf_1000.fdn
MODFLOW/mf_1000.lst
MODFLOW/rt3d_time_steps

# salinity outputs, Fortran scratch files, run logs
SALINITY/salt.output.*
fort.*
*.log

# tool leftovers and executables
*.exe
*.bak
*.rec
*.jac
*.jco
*.pst
